 g</text><text x=\"342.0\" y=\"274.0\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" style=\"fill:var(--muted)\">steady 1 g</text><text x=\"500.0\" y=\"70.0\" font-size=\"14\" text-anchor=\"start\" style=\"fill:var(--ink)\" font-weight=\"700\">ultimate = 1.5 × limit</text><text x=\"500.0\" y=\"100.0\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"start\" style=\"fill:var(--live)\" font-weight=\"700\">no ACT: 1.5 × 2.5 = 3.75 g</text><text x=\"500.0\" y=\"120.0\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"start\" style=\"fill:var(--accent)\" font-weight=\"700\">GLA: 1.5 × 2.0 = 3.0 g</text><text x=\"500.0\" y=\"156.0\" font-size=\"14\" text-anchor=\"start\" style=\"fill:var(--ink)\" font-weight=\"700\">root bending, ultimate</text><text x=\"500.0\" y=\"186.0\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"start\" style=\"fill:var(--live)\" font-weight=\"700\">2.0 MN·m × 3.75 = 7.5 MN·m</text><text x=\"500.0\" y=\"206.0\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"start\" style=\"fill:var(--accent)\" font-weight=\"700\">2.0 MN·m × 3.0 = 6.0 MN·m</text><text x=\"500.0\" y=\"242.0\" font-size=\"14\" text-anchor=\"start\" style=\"fill:var(--ink)\" font-weight=\"700\">design load cut</text><text x=\"500.0\" y=\"272.0\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"start\" style=\"fill:var(--ink)\" font-weight=\"700\">0.75 ÷ 3.75 = 20 %</text>",
   "aria": "Plot of load factor against time from 0 to 5 seconds. Both curves sit at 1 g until a gust at 1 second; the curve without active control peaks at 2.5 g and rings for several cycles, the curve with gust load alleviation peaks at 2.0 g and settles quickly. A side panel gives ultimate load factors 3.75 and 3.0 g, root bending 7.5 and 6.0 meganewton-metres, and a 20 percent cut."
